      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "#RESCUE - 🛟 Marine Interdiction Agents from the Fajardo and Ponce Marine Units responded to a vessel in distress near Punta Arena, Vieques, PR. After locating the disabled boat that was taking on water, MIAs rescued all four occupants and safely moved the vessel to Ceiba docks. Upon arrival at the Ceiba docks, local EMS personnel performed evaluations on everyone that was rescued. Additional Marine Interdictions Agents joined the crew at the docks to help with dewatering the vessel until it could be properly removed from the water. #MaritimeRescue #Teamwork",
