      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "🚨 Over 1.5 Tons of Cocaine seized in the Eastern Pacific!🚨\n\nLast week an AMO P-3 crew detected and tracked suspected Go-fast vessels during a radar patrol in the Eastern Pacific. Working with Joint Interagency Task Force South, the U.S. Coast Guard, and international partners the smuggling attempt was thwarted. The P-3 detection led to the recovery of 67 bales of cocaine weighing over 3,493 lbs. cocaine and three arrests. Outstanding teamwork in the fight against transnational crime! #CounterNarcotics #Teamwork",
      "text_resolved": "🚨 Over 1.5 Tons of Cocaine seized in the Eastern Pacific!🚨\n\nLast week an AMO P-3 crew detected and tracked suspected Go-fast vessels during a radar patrol in the Eastern Pacific. Working with Joint Interagency Task Force South, the U.S. Coast Guard, and international partners the smuggling attempt was thwarted. The P-3 detection led to the recovery of 67 bales of cocaine weighing over 3,493 lbs. cocaine and three arrests. Outstanding teamwork in the fight against transnational crime! #CounterNarcotics #Teamwork",
