      "text": "🚨⛑️Blackhawk Crew Executes Daring Hoist Extraction of Injured Border Patrol Agent in El Centro! \n \nYesterday, a San Diego Air and Marine Branch UH-60 Blackhawk crew responded to an injured El Centro Sector Border Patrol Agent. Due to challenging terrain and a possible broken leg, a hoist extraction was performed after a Rescue Specialist provided care on scene with fellow Border Patrol Agents. The agent was safely transported and transferred to local EMS near Ocotillo, CA. We stand ready to protect and support our brothers in arms—no matter the challenge! #RescueOperations",
